<title>UK: Cellnet nets 159,000 new digital customers.</title>
<headline>Cellnet nets 159,000 new digital customers.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK telecom group Cellnet, which is 40 percent owned by Securicor Group, said on Monday it had added 159,000 net digital connections in the three months to September, bringing its total digital customers to 654,000.  </p>
<p>&quot;Market connection figures released by Cellnet today show sustaned growth in the UK mobile phone business, bringing Cellnet's total customer base to 2.54 million,&quot; the group said in a statement.</p>
<p>Cellnet is 60 percent-owned by British Telecommunications Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 545 4017</p>
</text>
